## Related Finding (Same Root Cause, Same Files)

The visual and raw editor web routes (`/tm/content/visual/*`, `/tm/content/raw/*`) in `ControllerWebAuthor::showBlox()` / `showRaw()` also load draft content with only the `mycontent:read` role check and no ownership check. They are outside the reported API surface, but the same fix pattern should be applied there if the scope is expanded. This plan focuses on the reported API endpoints first.

